</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Peace, perfect peace, by thronging duties pressed?</l><l>To do the will of Jesus—this is rest.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Peace, perfect peace, with sorrows surging round?</l><l>On Jesus’ bosom naught but calm is found.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Peace, perfect peace, with loved ones far away?</l><l>In Jesus’ keeping we are safe, and they.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Peace, perfect peace, our future all unknown?</l><l>Jesus we know, and He is on the throne.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
